    "message": "ci(test-slots): remove dead ci-pr/ci-ref lookup tag emission\n\nThe deploy-image resolver now resolves CI images by the sha-\u003ccommit\u003e alias\n(romaine-life/glimmung#873, deployed), so the run-scoped ci-pr/ci-ref lookup\ntag is unread. Remove its emission from docker-build-check and migrate the\ncheck-image-fingerprint-config guard to assert the sha-\u003ccommit\u003e surface is\npresent and the retired ci-* surface is gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
